rved; one-sided item + kind | med/high: D17 network -> D18 process -> next likely file/registry |\n133\t\n134\tCounts: 77 rows; seen 27 (rows 1-18, 35, 48-52, 67, 70, 75), gap 50 (rows 66, 68, 69, 71, 72 have lib support built).\n135\t\n136\t## Recognition cues (worker quick-reference)\n137\t```\n138\tFINGERPRINT (first 512 bytes + `file`), never by extension:\n139\t FF FE / FE FF / NUL every 2nd byte -> UTF-16: iconv -f UTF-16LE -t UTF-8 first (.reg, PS \"Unicode\" saves, .inf)\n140\t 1F 8B gzip | PK\\x03\\x04 zip/ooxml(.docm .xlsm) | D0 CF 11 E0 OLE(.doc .xls .msi) | ITSF chm | 4C 00 00 00 01 14 02 00 lnk\n141\t E4 52 5C 7B onenote | \\x1bLua luac | FasdUAS .scpt | MEI\\x0c/PYZ pyinstaller | 0d0d0a pyc | #@~^ Script-Encoder -> wshenc\n142\tSHEBANG/HEADER -> language:\n143\t #!..perl / use strict; / my $descriptor_ -> perl (D15)   DESCRIPTOR_<HEX> = / def build_plan_ / ->(_env) -> ruby (D16)\n144\t #Requires AutoHotkey / x := \"..\" / Map( / ; comments -> autohotkey v2 (D17; family polyglot-auto_hotkey, underscore)\n145\t onOpen_ / DocumentApp / HtmlService / showSidebar / UrlFetchApp -> Google Apps Script (D18; polyglot-google_apps_script)\n146\t ExcelScript. / Office.onReady -> Office Scripts/add-in   \"manifest_version\" + chrome.runtime -> browser extension\n147\t #!..tclsh / set x \"v\" / proc -> tcl  x <- v / library( -> R          package main / := -> go\n148\t fn main / let mut / r#\"..\"# -> rust  val/fun + plugins{ -> kotlin(.kts)   pipeline{ stages{ / def x= -> groovy/Jenkinsfile\n149\t BEGIN{ / getline -> awk              target:\\n\\tcmd / $(shell -> make     FROM / RUN -> Dockerfile\n150\t on:/jobs:/runs-on: -> GH Actions     stages:/script: -> GitLab CI          - hosts:/tasks: -> ansible\n151\t resource \"x\" / provisioner \"local-exec\" -> terraform    Windows Registry Editor 5.00 -> .reg\n152\t [Version] Signature=\"$CHICAGO$\" -> .inf   [InternetShortcut] -> .url   [Shell] Command= -> .scf\n153\t <xsl:stylesheet + msxsl:script -> XSLT (msxsl/wmic