l String descriptor_<8hex> = \"..\"`, `def buildPlan_<id> = { -> [descriptor: ..].asImmutable() }`, host `pipeline { agent none; stages { stage('Analyze') { steps { echo .. } } } }`; family `polyglot-groovy`, host `host-jenkins-pipeline-groovy` | carried V3_MARK (unchanged); plan `language=groovy`, campaign `GROOVY-<8hex>`, url host `groovy-<10hex>`, attack T1059/T1105/none, host_profile `jenkins_pipeline`; `groovy` MISSING (never run) | carried; assembled GString/`.decodeBase64()` variant = med (gap groovy-literal-fold) |\"\"\")\nrep(\"\"\"| 75 | Server-side web-page hosts with an inline script (ASPX `<script runat=\"server\">`, `.ashx`/`.asmx` `<%@ WebHandler %>`, Razor `.cshtml` `@{ }`, classic ASP `<% %>` VBScript/JScript, JSP `<% %>`/`<%! %>`, ColdFusion `<cfscript>`) | seen D19 (aspx_inline_csharp; inner csx as an ESCAPED C# string `EmbeddedCsx_<id> = \"..\\\\n..\\\\\"..\\\\\";\"`) |\"\"\",\n\"\"\"| 75 | Server-side web-page hosts with an inline script (ASPX `<script runat=\"server\">`, `.ashx`/`.asmx` `<%@ WebHandler %>`, Razor `.cshtml` `@{ }`, classic ASP `<% %>` VBScript/JScript, JSP `<% %>`/`<%! %>`, ColdFusion `<cfscript>`) | seen D19 (aspx_inline_csharp; inner csx as an ESCAPED C# string `EmbeddedCsx_<id> = \"..\\\\n..\\\\\"..\\\\\";\"`), D20 (classic_asp: `<%@ Language=VBScript %>` + `<% ' marker` + `Dim descriptor_<id>` / assign next line + `Response.Write`, plain, in a `.vbs`) |\"\"\")\nrep(\"\"\"| 77 | JVM script hosts (JSP webshell, Groovy, Java single-file `java X.java`, Nashorn/Rhino `jrunscript`) | gap |\"\"\",\"\"\"| 77 | JVM script hosts (JSP webshell, Groovy, Java single-file `java X.java`, Nashorn/Rhino `jrunscript`) | Groovy seen D20 (row 22); JSP/Java/Kotlin gap |\"\"\")\nrep(\"| 23 | Kotlin script `.kts` / Gradle `build.gradle.kts` | gap |\",\"| 23 | Kotlin script `.kts` / Gradle `build.gradle.kts` (+ Scala `.sc`, Clojure `.clj`, BeanShell `.bsh`) | gap |\")\ns=s.replace(\"| `kotlinc` MISSING; static | med (Gradle build abuse) |\",\"| `kotlinc` MISSING; static; gap jvm-dsl-script-route | **high**: next JVM/build sibling after D20 Groovy/Jenkins |\")\nrep(\"| med/high: supply-chain host, family would be `polyglot-github_actions`-style |\",\"| **high**: CI sibling of D20 `jenkins_pipeline`; profile would read `github_actions_workflow`-style; gap pipeline-step-inner-scripts |\")\nrep(\"Counts: 77 rows; seen 27 (rows 1-18, 35, 48-52, 67, 70, 75), gap 50\",\"Counts: 77 rows; seen 28 (rows 1-18, 22, 35, 48-52, 67, 70, 75; 77 partly), gap 49\")\n# cues: modify existing lines (keep <=60)\nrep(\"\"\" fn main / let mut / r#\"..\"# -> rust  val/fun + plugins{ -> kotlin(.kts)   pipeline{ stages{ / def x= -> groovy/Jenkinsfile\"\"\",\n\"\"\" fn main / let mut / r#\"..\"# -> rust  val/fun + plugins{ -> kotlin(.kts)   final String x= / def f = { -> / pipeline{ -> groovy (D20)\"\"\")\nrep(\"\"\" <Project ..msbuild> + UsingTask -> MSBuild    Installer + [RunInstaller(true)] -> InstallUtil C#   <%@ Page/runat=\"server\" -> ASPX (D19)\"\"\",\n\"\"\" <Project ..msbuild> + UsingTask -> MSBuild   <%@ Page/runat=\"server\" -> ASPX (D19)   <%@ Language=VBScript %> -> classic ASP (D20)\n host-<profile>-<lang> may wrap an OLD language (D20 classic_asp VBScript in a .vbs): marker first, plan says language=\"\"\")\nrep(\"\"\" .003 cmd .004 unix shell .005 VB .006 python .007 JS .010 AutoHotKey/AutoIt .011 Lua; v=3 plans used parent T1059 (C# D19 too).\"\"\",\n\"\"\" .003 cmd .004 unix shell .005 VB .006 python .007 JS .010 AutoHotKey/AutoIt .011 Lua; v=3 plans used parent T1059 (C#, Groovy too).\"\"\")\n# readiness gaps prose + json\ni=s.index(\"## Readiness gaps\"); \ns=s[:i]+\"\"\"## Readiness gaps\nBuilt by the nightly prebuild (dropped from the queue, still usable from lib/): D16-D18 nights (see git history: encoding,\nequivalence, regime, network/process telemetry, download graph, SPLIT array, SaaS/YAML/reg/inf/Docker/Make routes, ...) and D19\nnight nested-string-carrier-unescape (`lib.codec.inner_scripts`), managed-bridge-hosts (`managed_host`), dotnet-assembly-strings,\ncsharp-literal-fold, fsharp-vbnet-script-route, handoff-chain-resolve (`handoff_graph`/`handoff_answer`), jvm-script-host-route.\nGiven up (2 attempts): python-exec-onion-static, evidence-type-router, file-registry-telemetry-reconcile (narrow retry queued as\nevidence-magic-classifier). Prebuild gate: lib imports limited to hctf/prebuild.py ALLOWED_IMPORTS (stdlib parsers + Crypto/\ncryptography/dpkt/Evtx/pefile/olefile/dnfile; no csv/ast/shlex/marshal). Priority-1 order for D21: the CI/build-host thread D20\nopened (pipeline step bodies -> JVM/Kotlin DSL route -> Groovy literal fold) and hosts for prior languages; then notebooks/\nmanifests (JSON-escaped carriers), execution-locus modelling, other compiled-language sources, Jenkins secrets.\n\n```json\n\"\"\"+\"PLACEHOLDER\"+\"\\n```\\n\"\ngaps=[\n {\"id\":\"pipeline-step-inner-scripts\",\"concept\":\"CI/build pipeline step bodies that embed PRIOR-language scripts (Jenkinsfile sh/bat/powershell, GH Actions run:, GitLab script:, Azure Pipelines)\",\"priority\":1,\"action\":\"prebuild\",\"detail\":\"D20 prompt: 'trace the modeled build into its prior-language stages'. pipeline_steps(name, src)->[{stage, step_kind, shell/lang, body, agent_label}] for: Jenkins declarative/scripted Groovy (`stage('x') { steps { sh '''..''' / sh(script: \\\"..\\\", returnStdout: true) / bat '..' / powershell '..' / pwsh '..' / script { .. } } }`, `node('label') {}`, `agent { label 'x' } / docker { image 'x' }`), GitHub Actions YAML (`jobs.<id>.runs-on`, `steps[].run` block scalars `|`/`>` with `shell: bash|pwsh|python|cmd`, `uses: actions/github-script` `script:`), GitLab CI (`script:`/`before_script:` lists, `image:`, `tags:`), Azure Pipelines (`- script:` `- bash:` `- powershell:` `- pwsh:`), CircleCI `run: command:`, Bitbucket `script:`, Drone `commands:`. Unescape Groovy '''/\\\"\\\"\\\"/GString `${}` and YAML block/flow scalars (reuse lib.codec _yaml_* + inner_scripts), map shell->lang (sh/bash->bash, bat/cmd->batch, powershell/pwsh->powershell, python->python, node/github-script->node) and run v3_plan/find_codecs on every body. Gate: D20 jenkins host + synthetic Jenkinsfile/GHA/GitLab fixtures wrapping D1-D20 plans in each step kind; D1-D20 members unchanged.\"},\n {\"id\":\"prior-language-host-battery\",\"concept\":\"host files that wrap an OLD language (D20 classic_asp VBScript): ASP JScript, WSC, Jupyter Python, systemd/cron Bash, Electron Node, NSE Lua, GPO/task-XML PowerShell\",\"priority\":1,\"action\":\"prebuild\",\"detail\":\"D20 shipped `host-classic-asp-vbscript.vbs` (`<%@ Language=VBScript %>` + `<% ' HUNTRESS_ANALYSIS_V1:B64-.. %>` + `Dim descriptor_<id>` / assignment on the next line) -- the first host for a prior language. Build a fixture battery + reader check for likely siblings, each wrapping a D1-D20 plan: classic ASP `<script language=\\\"JScript\\\" runat=\\\"server\\\">` and `<%@ Language=JScript %>`; Windows Script Component `.wsc` (`<component><registration progid=..><script language=\\\"VBScript\\\"><![CDATA[..]]>`); systemd unit `ExecStart=/bin/bash -c '..'` + `# marker`; crontab line `* * * * * bash -c \\\"..\\\"`; `.desktop` `Exec=sh -c`; Electron `package.json` `main` + `preload.js`; Nmap NSE `.nse` (`description = [[..]]`, `--` marker); Redis `EVAL \\\"lua\\\"`; Task Scheduler XML `<Exec><Command>powershell.exe</Command><Arguments>-enc ..</Arguments>`; GPO `scripts.ini`/`psscripts.ini`; Outlook `VbaProject.OTM`; `.inf` RunPreSetupCommands -> batch. For each: lib.codec.v3_plan/find_codecs must return the plan; managed_host-style profile guess `<container>_<lang>` (classic_asp, wsc_component, systemd_unit, cron_entry, jupyter_notebook, electron_preload, nmap_nse, scheduled_task_xml). Gate: 0 regressions on D1-D20 members.\"},\n {\"id\":\"jvm-dsl-script-route\",\"concept\":\"next JVM/build languages: Kotlin .kts / Gradle build.gradle(.kts), Java single-file + JSP, Scala .sc, Clojure .clj, BeanShell .bsh, Jython/JRuby\",\"priority\":1,\"action\":\"prebuild\",\"detail\":\"After D20 Groovy, verify the marker/descriptor readers on: Kotlin `val descriptor_<id> = \\\"..\\\"` / `const val` / raw `\\\"\\\"\\\"..\\\"\\\"\\\".trimIndent()` / `${}` templates / `mapOf(\\\"descriptor\\\" to ..)`, Gradle `tasks.register(\\\"x\\\") { doLast { exec { commandLine(..) } } }`, `ext.descriptor = '..'`; Java `static final String DESCRIPTOR_<ID> = \\\"..\\\";` with `\\\\\\\\uXXXX` escapes processed BEFORE lexing, text blocks `\\\"\\\"\\\"`; JSP `<%-- --%>`/`<%! %>`; Scala `val descriptor_x = \\\"..\\\"`, `s\\\"..\\\"`, triple quotes; Clojure `; marker` + `(def descriptor-<id> \\\"..\\\")` (hyphenated name!) + `#_` discard; BeanShell; `//`, `/* */`, `#`, `;;` comment markers. Family guesses `polyglot-kotlin_script`, `polyglot-gradle_kotlin`, `polyglot-java`, `polyglot-scala`, `polyglot-clojure`; host guesses `gradle_build`, `jsp_scriptlet`, `maven_pom`. Gate: fixture battery of D20 plans in each syntax; D1-D20 unchanged.\"},\n {\"id\":\"groovy-literal-fold\",\"concept\":\"static folding of assembled Groovy/Kotlin strings (descriptor built at runtime)\",\"priority\":1,\"action\":\"prebuild\",\"detail\":\"Mutation risk for the D20 language: fold GString `\\\"${a}${b}\\\"` over local literals, `'..' + '..'`, `[..].join('')`/`.join()`, `.reverse()`, `.decodeBase64()` / `new String(x.decodeBase64())` / `Base64.getDecoder().decode(..)`, `.decodeHex()`, `[118, 61, ..] as byte[]` / `as char[]`, `.collect { it as char }.join()`, `(char) 0x76`, `String.format`, `.tr(..)`, slashy `/../` and dollar-slashy `$/../$` strings, `'''..'''` and `\\\"\\\"\\\"..\\\"\\\"\\\"` with `\\\\` line continuations, `.stripIndent()`, Kotlin `buildString { append(..) }`, `listOf(..).joinToString(\\\"\\\")`, `String(byteArrayOf(..))`, `.toByteArray().map { it xor key }`. Pure regex + const-propagation over literals (no ast, no groovy). Gate: D20 Groovy plans re-assembled in each form fold back to the same plan.\"},\n {\"id\":\"notebook-manifest-json-carrier\",\"concept\":\"scripts carried inside JSON documents: Jupyter .ipynb, VS Code tasks.json/launch.json, package.json scripts, Logic App/Power Automate, .devcontainer\",\"priority\":2,\"action\":\"prebuild\",\"detail\":\"Combines D18 (multi-line array) and D19 (escaped inner text): an `.ipynb` stores each cell's `source` as a JSON ARRAY of lines with `\\\\n` escapes; outputs hold base64 `image/png`/`text/plain`; `metadata.kernelspec.language` names the language. json_scripts(name, data)->[{path, lang, text}] walking every string (join list-of-lines `source`, decode JSON escapes, `%%bash`/`!cmd`/`%run` cell magics -> bash, `%%powershell`), VS Code `tasks.json` `command`/`args` + `runOptions.runOn: folderOpen` (auto-run abuse), package.json `scripts.preinstall/postinstall/prepare`, composer.json `scripts`, `.devcontainer.json` `postCreateCommand`, Logic App `definition.actions.*.inputs`. Then v3_plan/find_codecs per text. Gate: synthetic notebook/tasks/package fixtures wrapping D1-D20 plans; tolerate JSON with comments (JSONC) and trailing commas.\"},\n {\"id\":\"build-manifest-hooks\",\"concept\":\"package/build lifecycle hooks as script hosts (supply-chain sibling of Jenkins)\",\"priority\":2,\"action\":\"prebuild\",\"detail\":\"install-time execution surfaces: npm `package.json` lifecycle scripts + `binding.gyp` actions; Python `setup.py` `cmdclass={'install': ..}` / `pyproject.toml` `[tool.setuptools]` / `.pth` files with `import` lines; Ruby `.gemspec` `extensions` + `extconf.rb`; Rust `build.rs`; Go `//go:generate`; Maven `pom.xml` `exec-maven-plugin` `<executable>`/`<arguments>` + `maven-antrun-plugin` `<exec>`; Gradle `exec {}`; MSBuild `.csproj` `<Target BeforeTargets=..><Exec Command=..>`; NuGet `tools/install.ps1`; Makefile/CMake `execute_process`. hooks(name, src)->[{hook, when (install|build|test|import), command, lang}] + ATT&CK hints (T1195.001/.002 supply chain, T1059.x by lang). Gate: battery wrapping D1-D20 plans; D1-D20 unchanged.\"},\n {\"id\":\"pipeline-execution-locus\",\"concept\":\"where each pipeline step actually runs (Jenkins controller vs agent; GHA hosted vs self-hosted; container vs host)\",\"priority\":2,\"action\":\"prebuild\",\"detail\":\"D20 prompt: 'separate controller semantics from agent semantics, not every step runs where it appears to'. In Jenkins, Groovy CPS code outside `sh`/`bat`/`powershell` (incl. `script {}` blocks, `@NonCPS` methods, `readFile`/`writeFile` vs `new File()`, `\\\"cmd\\\".execute()`, `Jenkins.instance`, `load`, shared-library `vars/*.groovy`, `@Grab`) runs on the CONTROLLER even inside `node {}`; only durable-task steps (`sh`, `bat`, `powershell`, `pwsh`) and file steps run on the agent; `agent none` + stage-level `agent { label }`. execution_locus(pipeline)->[{stage, step, locus: controller|agent|container, evidence}] and locus_answer(..., accepted_values, what=) for 'which step runs on the controller', 'count of agent steps', 'the step that only appears to run on the agent'. GHA analogue: `runs-on: self-hosted`, `container:`, `pull_request_target` + checkout of PR head. Gate: synthetic Jenkinsfiles with known loci.\"},\n {\"id\":\"compiled-lang-source-route\",\"concept\":\"v=3 polyglots in Go / Rust / Nim / Zig / Dart / Swift / JXA sources\",\"priority\":2,\"action\":\"prebuild\",\"detail\":\"Languages still unpolyglotted with non-`=` descriptor syntax: Go `descriptor_x := \\\"..\\\"` / `var descriptor_x = `..`` raw backticks / `const`; Rust `const DESCRIPTOR_X: &str = \\\"..\\\";` / `r#\\\"..\\\"#` / `\\\\u{..}`; Nim `let descriptor_x = \\\"\\\"\\\"..\\\"\\\"\\\"` / `#[ ]#`; Zig `const descriptor_x = \\\"..\\\";` / `\\\\\\\\` multiline strings; Dart `final descriptor_x = '..';` / `r'..'`; Swift `let descriptor_x = \\\"\\\"\\\"..\\\"\\\"\\\"` / `#\\\"..\\\"#`; JXA `ObjC.import`/`Application('System Events')` + JS. Make sure descriptor-syntax-generic + v3_plan read all of them (marker in `//`, `/* */`, `#`); family guesses `polyglot-go`, `polyglot-rust`, `polyglot-swift`, `polyglot-jxa`. Gate: fixture battery of D20 plans; D1-D20 unchanged.\"},\n {\"id\":\"jenkins-artifact-secrets\",\"concept\":\"Jenkins home artifacts: credentials.xml / config.xml / build.xml / hudson.util.Secret decryption\",\"priority\":3,\"action\":\"prebuild\",\"detail\":\"A Jenkins-themed escalation might ship JENKINS_HOME files. jenkins_secrets(files: {name: bytes})->[{id, kind, value}]: parse `credentials.xml` (`<password>{AQAAABAAAA..}</password>`, `<privateKey>`, `<secret>`), job `config.xml` (`<command>` of hudson.tasks.Shell / BatchFile, `<script>` of flow-definition CpsFlowDefinition = Jenkinsfile text -> pipeline-step-inner-scripts), `builds/N/build.xml`/`log`. Decrypt: master.key -> sha256[:16] AES-128-ECB key decrypts `secrets/hudson.util.Secret` (needs `::::MAGIC::::` suffix); new format `{AQAAABAAAA..}` = version 1, iv len, data len, AES-128-CBC with PKCS7; old format AES-128-ECB with `::::MAGIC::::`. Use Crypto/cryptography (both in ALLOWED_IMPORTS). Gate: self-generated master.key/Secret fixtures round-trip.\"},\n {\"id\":\"evidence-magic-classifier\",\"concept\":\"narrow retry of the given-up evidence-type-router: classify non-script members by magic/shape only\",\"priority\":3,\"action\":\"prebuild\",\"detail\":\"evidence-type-router failed twice (scope too big). This is the classifier ONLY: evidence_kind(name, data)->{kind, reader} with kinds script|pcap|pcapng|har|zeek|evtx|sysmon_xml|json_lines|auditd|ps_listing|procmon_csv|w3c|squid|jenkins_xml|notebook|unknown by magic (`D4C3B2A1`, `0A0D0D0A`, `ElfFile\\\\x00`), first-line shape (`#fields`, `#Software: Microsoft`, `type=SYSCALL`, `UID PID PPID`, `{\\\"log\\\":{\\\"entries\\\"`, `\\\"nbformat\\\"`), and reader = the existing lib.codec function name (network_indicators, process_events, ...). No new readers. Gate: every D1-D20 member classifies as `script`.\"},\n]\ns=s.replace(\"PLACEHOLDER\", \"[\\n\"+\",\\n\".join(\"  \"+json.dumps(g) for g in gaps)+\",\\n__KEEP__\\n]\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\necho ok"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":431,"cache_read_input_tokens":93161,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":431},"output_tokens":16,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b96ef0ef-0289-4580-868e-260beb3f4fda","uuid":"730e9af3-61da-4ea1-aa6f-4ac02890a5b9","timestamp":"2026-10-20T13:18:53.851Z","request_id":"req_011CgDZ4rZxswYYmifH6YPaQ","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_017KmSXVoNTxF3YR92w76TUN":{"command":"cd /home/testpwn/huntress-2026 && python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport json,re\np='reference/coverage/script-analysis.md'\ns=open(p).read()\ndef rep(a,b):\n    global s\n    assert s.count(a)==1, a[:70]\n    s=s.replace(a,b)\nrep(\"# script-analysis — coverage atlas (D1-D19 seen vs. D20+ candidates)\",\"# script-analysis — coverage atlas (D1-D20 seen vs. D21+ candidates)\")\ni=s.index(\"Updated 2026-10-19\"); j=s.index(\"Read with `reference/techniques\")\ns=s[:i]+\"\"\"Updated 2026-10-20 after D20 (1329 ids, 145 members; D20 \"The Butler Did It\" / base `jenkins-pipeline-intrusion` added\nGroovy `.groovy` + a `jenkins_pipeline` host AND a `classic_asp` host for the OLD language VBScript (`.vbs` file holding an ASP\npage) + 2 Bash; all plain one-line v=3 carriers, no twist; single CORRECT T+13 s 0 wrong, TT 5.0 s, Mastery 11.9 s first try).\nEvery D19-night gap is built except evidence-type-router / file-registry-telemetry-reconcile (given up, 2 attempts each), so\nthe queue below is rebuilt from the D20 direction (CI/build hosts, JVM languages, hosts for prior languages). \"\"\"+s[j:]\nrep(\"\"\"  `\\\\\"`-quoted (lib.codec.v3_plan handles it; the carried solve.py needed a patch). The real D20+ risk\"\"\",\"\"\"  `\\\\\"`-quote